        "original_id": "651d5959-791e-5f5e-a85b-9d4922b95ea3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Todd Field, Aaron Katz, Ben Stambler, Brendan McFadden\n- Works: Too Romantic, Cold Weather\n- Organizations: AFI Conservatory, Academy Awards\n- Places: Portland, Oregon\n- Roles: actor, filmmaker, writer, director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Todd Field was born on February 24, 1964, and he is an American actor and filmmaker.\n- Aaron Katz was born on October 29, 1981, and he is an award-winning independent American filmmaker from Portland, Oregon.\n- Too Romantic is a 1992 dramatic short film that Todd Field created while he was a fellow at the AFI Conservatory.\n- Cold Weather is an American mystery film written by Aaron Katz, Ben Stambler, and Brendan McFadden.\n- Cold Weather was directed by Aaron Katz and produced by Ben Stambler and Brendan McFadden.\n- Todd Field has received three Academy Award nominations.",
